msgstr "[03-layer-norm.py](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/blob/main/third_party/ascend/unittest/autotune_ut/03-layer-norm.py)"

msgid "小结"
msgstr "Summary"

msgid "Triton-Ascend相比社区autotune的关键扩展，不是改变用户接口，而是在社区接口之上增加了“自动生成Tiling候选并完成寻优”的能力。对大多数用户来说，最推荐的使用方式就是："
msgstr "The key extension of Triton-Ascend compared to the community autotune does not change the user interface. Instead, it adds the capability to automatically generate tiling candidates and perform optimization search on top of the community interface. For most users, the most recommended usage is:"

msgid "保持社区版 `@triton.autotune` 的写法；"
msgstr "Keep the writing style of the community edition `@triton.autotune`;"

msgid "将 `configs` 设为 `[]`；"
msgstr "Set `configs` to `[]`;"

msgid "让Ascend backend基于kernel DSL和运行时shape自动完成候选生成、筛选、benchmark与缓存复用。"
msgstr "Enable the Ascend backend to automatically perform candidate generation, filtering, benchmarking, and cache reuse based on the kernel DSL and runtime shape."

msgid "如果场景不适合自动Tiling模式，再回到手写 `triton.Config` 即可。"
msgstr "If the automatic tiling mode does not fit your scenario, you can revert to manually writing `triton.Config`."
